      "intro": {
        "zh": "透過日常對話、錄音和拼音練習，按自己的步伐學習香港客家話。我們希望以易於使用的學習資源，提升客家話的可學習性，讓更多人學會和使用客家話。",
        "en": "Learn Hong Kong Hakka at your own pace through everyday conversations, recordings and pronunciation guides. By making learning resources accessible, we aim to make Hakka easier to learn and use."
